    "tech_en": "WinEdge is a converged edge computing AI inference system launched by Huiwen Technology. It integrates image-based and data-based AI inference capabilities, and can be paired with the image-based AI model training platform AIWinOps and the data-based AI model training platform NumOps to form a complete WinHub.AI artificial intelligence implementation solution. The platform uses advanced quantitative model inference technology to achieve ultimate computing performance on local devices without sacrificing accuracy, and can perform real-time processing without relying on cloud resources. WinEdge supports centralized monitoring of multiple devices and one-click model update. It can provide low-latency, high-privacy real-time warnings for construction site safety, machine abnormality monitoring and other fields, effectively assisting enterprises to quickly import AI models from the development stage to actual applications at the production site. , 1.classification: YOLOv8-cls, YOLO11-cls 2.object detection: YOLOv4, YOLOv8, YOLO11 3.segmentation: YOLOv8-seg, YOLO11-seg 4.Classification: AutoML, XGBoost, GBM, DRF, XRT, GLM 5.Regression: AutoML, XGBoost, GBM, DRF, XRT, GLM 6.Time Series: RNN, LSTM, GRU, Prophet",
    "benefit_en": "Solved pain points: 1. Manual visual inspection is unstable and can easily miss minor defects. 2. It is difficult to provide early warning for abnormal situations, and downtime affects production capacity. 3. Dangerous behaviors are difficult to detect immediately, and security control relies on manpower. Benefit description: WinEdge is an edge AI solution with local real-time inference as the core, combined with multi-device real-time monitoring and centralized management and deployment technology. The platform supports multi-camera imaging and one-click model update, and can achieve high-performance image processing and NG image storage locally without relying on cloud resources. Through object tracking, area counting and industrial communication protocol connection, WinEdge can instantly integrate key data and display inference results through dashboards, helping organizations achieve automated early warning, precise defect detection and cross-device centralized monitoring in a private environment that ensures data privacy, thereby optimizing operational decisions and greatly improving site security. Technical description: It is an imaging AI implementation solution with edge AI inference as the core and integrating machine learning inference and deep learning inference technology.  The platform uses advanced quantitative model inference technology to achieve ultimate computing performance on local devices without sacrificing accuracy, and can perform real-time image processing without relying on cloud resources. WinEdge supports centralized monitoring of multiple devices and one-click model update. It can provide low-latency, high-privacy real-time warnings for areas such as construction site safety, glass defects, or process abnormalities, effectively assisting enterprises to quickly import AI models from the development stage to actual applications at the production site.",
