    "benefit_en": "[1. Core pain points that the Foresight NexusAI platform can solve] 1. Information islands and data fractures: Equipment, MES, ERP, detection and reporting systems are independent of each other and cannot form a complete data chain, resulting in the inability to flow and integrate information in real time. 2. Passive quality management: Most companies are still stuck in \"post-event inspection\" and lack real-time warning and prediction capabilities, resulting in continued increase in scrap, rework and customer complaint costs. 3. Knowledge cannot be deposited and replicated: key experience relies on personnel and lacks a structured knowledge system, resulting in high training costs and unstable decision-making quality. 4. The decision-making response speed is too slow: it takes a lot of time from data collection to report analysis and cannot support real-time operational decisions. 5. The process is highly dependent on manual work: repetitive operations and cross-system operations cause low efficiency and risk of errors. 6. The threshold for AI introduction is high and it is difficult to scale up: AI projects are scattered and lack platform management and continuous optimization mechanisms, resulting in difficulty in introduction and high failure rate. [2. Overall benefits that the Foresight NexusAI platform can bring] 1. Comprehensive improvement in operational efficiency: data acquisition, analysis and decision-making time are shortened from \"hours/days\" to \"minutes or even seconds\", and the production process is automated and intelligent, greatly reducing manual dependence. 2. Steady improvement in quality and yield: from \"spot inspection\" to \"full inspection\" and \"predictive quality control\", the defective rate has been significantly reduced and product stability has been improved. 3. Cost structure optimization (cost reduction and efficiency improvement): labor costs are reduced (testing, reporting, administrative processes), scrap, heavy work and sudden equipment maintenance costs are reduced. 4. Decision-making capability upgrade (Data-driven Organization): Real-time grasp of KPIs and abnormal conditions, switching from experience-based decision-making to data-based decision-making 5. Knowledge assetization and organizational upgrading: Transform experience into a replicable AI knowledge system, shorten new employee training time, and improve organizational learning capabilities. 6. Sustainable and scalable AI introduction: Establish a replicable AI application architecture to support cross-field and cross-production line expansion [3. Foresight NexusAI platform core technology architecture] 1. Data integration and governance capabilities (Data Foundation): IoT device data collection and machine networking, multi-system data integration (MES / ERP / AOI / SPC), data cleaning, standardization and middle-end architecture 2. AI modeling and prediction capabilities (AI Engine): No-Code/Low-Code AI modeling, timing prediction, anomaly detection, quality prediction, virtual metrology and process control 3. Multi-modal AI and generative AI capabilities (AI Copilot): LLM (large language model), RAG (enterprise knowledge retrieval generation), image + text multi-modal understanding 4️.Real-time decision-making and visualization capabilities (Decision Layer): real-time KPI monitoring and early warning, automatic report generation and insight analysis, natural language query (Ask Data) 5. Process automation and execution capabilities (Action Layer): RPA process automation, AI decision-driven process execution, automatic connection between systems and task orchestration 6. Continuous learning and optimization capabilities (Learning Loop): continuous training and optimization of AI models, feedback mechanism (Closed-loop learning), cross-field experience reuse",
